      "family": "pole",
      "title": "Pole: Hook pole",
      "text": [
        "Wooden poles with alternating pattern of hook-shaped insulators are really common in Latvia. They might appear sometimes in other countries but if you see them with flat landscape you gonna be most likely in Latvia(If you vibe baltics). Always try using other clues to confirm it."
